### Vite environment variables for WELLTH APP frontend
# Copy this file to `.env` or `.env.local` for development.

# Base URL for backend API (omit trailing slash). For local dev using the provided backend:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001/api
# API Configuration
# In development, Vite proxy handles /api -> http://localhost:3001
# In production, set this to your backend URL
VITE_API_URL=/api